  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2207.01 Use of Uniform Classification of Accounts. All forms in this part shall be completed using the uniform classification of accounts described in this chapter.\n\nSource. #5455, eff 8-28-92; ss by #6808, eff 7-21-98; ss by #8687, eff 7-21-06; ss by #9486, eff 6-23-09; ss by #10652, eff 8-8-14 (from Rev 2208.01); ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24",
